# Cline ignore file - patterns for files/directories Cline should skip
# Based on RoboTank-ESP32 project structure

## Build artifacts and PlatformIO outputs
.platformio/
*.o
*.d
*/build/

## Binary and compiled files
*.bin
*.elf
*.map
*.a
*.lib

## SD card data files (binary data, not relevant to code development)
sdcard/*.AD4

## Schematics media files (large images, PDFs)
schematics/*.png
schematics/*.jpg
schematics/*.drawio
schematics/3D Models/*
schematics/RoboTank-ESP32/*

## Memory bank directory (managed internally by Cline)
memory-bank/

## Git related (already tracked by git)
.git/
.gitmodules

## IDE specific artifacts
.vscode/!.vscodeignore
.vscode/*.json